[00:30.359]It's magic when snowflakes could cling (雪花停驻在你身上)
[00:36.595]Like powdered stardust on your skin, glistening (如同星尘泼洒，晶莹闪烁)
[00:43.142]Their moments may be fleet and paper thin (落雪只可留存片刻)
[00:48.785]But through your voyage they will sing (歌声却会在你的旅途中传唱)
[00:53.272]Soaring like the paper plane we dreamed (如梦中的纸飞机般翱翔)
[00:59.733]Coasting through the trails we paved (飞过我们开辟的航迹)
[01:04.112]It’s not make believe (这并非虚幻)
[01:06.202]Fly 'til frost turns to spring (飞吧——直到霜雪化作春意)
[01:09.845]Carry the torch for me and spread your wings (传递炬火，挥展翅膀)
[01:14.465]I will cast a glow up from your sky (在你的天空下投射光芒)
[01:18.999]Your ever-guiding light (永远为你领航)
[01:25.603]Names of greats that make history (再伟大的名字)
[01:31.670]Cave in time to fadeaway memories (在时间的流转中，也会沉淀为被遗忘的尘埃)
[01:36.767]But I won't let it faze me (但我不会因此动摇)
[01:40.538]Cause I don't pine for what's to be of me (因我从不渴求被铭记)
[01:45.611]"Up in the air" (“漂浮空中”)
[01:47.074]Isn't "nowhere" (并不等于“无处可去”)
[01:49.650]So there's no floating 'round aimlessly (我并非在漫无目的地漂泊)
[01:52.900]Look on up and you'll see (抬头仰望，你会看到)
[01:56.319]It grows, and grows, and most of all (那生生不息的)
[01:59.634]So alive and bursting with (正迸发出)
[02:03.153]Colors all blossoming (绽放的万紫千红)
[02:05.879]What the plan's been promising (正如我们心中渴望：)
[02:08.790]The end's another new beginning ahead (终点亦是新的开始)
[02:21.029]Did I catch a twinkle in your eye? (我是否望见了你眼中的星光？)
[02:27.476]Did they really mirror mine? (它可曾映照着我的模样？)
[02:31.713]I wanna believe (我想要相信)
[02:34.866]It's what keeps my wish afloat (让愿望振翅远飞)
[02:41.441]I hope you know (想要传达给你)
[02:46.880]Soaring like the paper plane we dreamed (如梦中的纸飞机般翱翔)
[02:53.322]Coasting through the trails we paved (飞过我们开辟的航迹)
[02:57.607]It's not make believe (这并非朦胧梦境)
[02:59.732]Fly 'til frost turns to spring (飞吧——直到霜雪化作春意)
[03:03.431]Carry the torch for me and spread your wings (传递炬火，挥展翅膀)
[03:08.941]I will cast a glow up from your sky (在你的天空下投射光芒)
[03:12.514]Your ever-guiding light (成为你永远的引路光)
[03:18.204]Ooh
